mmendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-29T16:06:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"6c5c1042-f632-40e3-939f-195ffa07428c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561318624,"PostDateInt":1793175747000,"PostDate":"2026-10-28T16:22:27","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件测试实习生(J14353)","OrgId":700264901,"Org":"TES解决方案一部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"4K-6K 元/月","Duty":"1、协助完成无线通信产品（如Wi-Fi/BT/GNSS等）的射频指标测试，包括发射功率、接收灵敏度、EVM、频偏等；\n2、协助完成整机功耗测试，在不同工作模式（待机、运行、睡眠等）下记录电流与电压数据；\n3、协助电池充放电测试，包括充电曲线、放电容量、过压/欠压保护、充电截止电流等；\n4、参与信号质量测试（如眼图、上升/下降时间、时序逻辑），协助分析信号完整性问题；\n5、进行电源纹波与噪声测试，使用示波器测量DC-DC、LDO输出纹波，并记录峰峰值；\n6、执行软重启、硬掉电以及存储压力测试测试用例；\n7、整理测试数据，撰写测试报告，并对发现的问题及时进行反馈。","Require":"1、电子类相关相关专业，本科或硕士在读；\n2、了解基本硬件测试仪器使用，如示波器、万用表、频谱分析仪、电子负载、信号发生器等；\n3、熟悉常见电源管理参数（纹波、效率）及电池特性（电池充放电曲线）；\n4、对射频基础概念有一定理解（dBm、频率、带宽、增益等）；\n5、具备基本焊接能力（如更换电容、焊接测试线）及电路图阅读能力；\n6、每周可保证至少4-5天到岗，实习期不少于3个月；\n7、工作细致、有责任心，具备良好的数据记录习惯与团队协作意识。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-28T16:22:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"9193df7e-2af1-47a0-9446-edf459db72f9","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561318561,"PostDateInt":1793172800000,"PostDate":"2026-10-28T15:33:20","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"NPI测试工程师(J14352)","OrgId":700519302,"Org":"计算解决方案事业群","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1. 项目前期评审 & DFT 可测性设计 参与原理图、PCB、结构评审，做 DFT 可测性评估；提出测试点、边界扫描、ICT/FCT 方案建议；评估测试成本、测试工时、治具 / 设备预算，输出测试方案、Test Plan、测试覆盖率、\n2. 统筹 NPI 各阶段测试方案开发与落地（EVT/DVT/PVT） 主导 射频、音频、功耗、老化、ATE 自动化测试方案评审；负责测试治具、测试工装、自动化测试台的选型、开发、验收、GR&R 验证；组织测试程序开发、调试、版本管控。\n3. 试产跟进、良率与异常闭环 全程跟进 EVT/DVT/PVT 试产，收集测试LOG,熟练使用minitab进行GR&R及CPK分析，主导测试失效分析，区分是硬件设计、软件、物料、治具、测试程序、产线工艺问题；使用 8D、5Why、DOE 推动改善，跟踪 CAPA 闭环，输出试产总结报告。\n4. 跨部门协同 & 转产放行 对接研发（硬件 / 射频 / 驱动）、NPI、生产、品质、供应商、ODM 工厂；定义各阶段测试准入 / 准出门槛；推动新产品从试产顺利转量产，负责量产爬坡阶段测试良率提升、复测率降低、测试效率优化。","Require":"1. 本科及以上，电子信息、通信、自动化、测控等相关专业；\n2. 5年以上消费电子硬件测试 / NPI 测试经验，熟悉完整 新产品导入流程；\n3.  熟悉FCT、ATE、射频测试、音频、功耗、老化等产线测试方案；\n4.  熟练使用示波器、频谱仪、信号源、程控电源等仪器；\n5. 熟悉自动化测试平台、治具开发、MES 对接优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-28T15:33:20","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"349c2328-2357-44b7-a04d-e866caaef470","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561318528,"PostDateInt":1793169434000,"PostDate":"2026-10-28T14:37:14","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级硬件测试工程师(J14351)","OrgId":700519304,"Org":"TES事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["陕西省·西安市","广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"10K-20K 元/月","Duty":"1. 负责整机产品的硬件测试工作，包括：射频指标测试(4G/5G/WIFI等指标)，基带测试（不同电路及器件的时序，压力挂测等）；\n2. 设备外设器件MIC，SPK，Audio PA， Codec，语音芯片，CAMERA，LCD，Flash，电池/充电IC等指标测试及验收；\n3. 研发内部日常开发过程中新器件引入的相关性测试；\n4. 整机产品高低温相关测试及操作；\n5. 按测试方案执行各阶段测试用例并输出完整的测试报告；\n6. 协助开发人员对研发内部测试问题，市场故障进行定位分析，跟踪测试问题debug进度。","Require":"1. 本科或以上学历，通信、电子等相关专业优先；\n2. 至少5年或以上硬件测试经验；\n3. 熟练使用测试仪器仪表（CMW500/MT8000A/E7515B/MT8821C/示波器/温箱/直流电源/万用表/静电放电发生器等），并能够搭建测试环境；\n4. 熟练使用风枪、烙铁，具备基本的焊接能力（飞线，更换简单器件）；\n5. 熟悉PCB绘图软件，如PADS等，熟悉射频&基带测试方法。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-28T14:37:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"7465e54c-3903-4532-b43e-ab84dde69ac5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561318523,"PostDateInt":1793168530000,"PostDate":"2026-10-28T14:22:10","EndTimeInt":0,