ing":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-14T09:02:28","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"beb833fa-0591-41cd-bdf3-531be2cf97ed","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561314067,"PostDateInt":1791883439000,"PostDate":"2026-10-13T17:23:59","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"穿戴销售（方案型客户开拓）(J14322)","OrgId":700313486,"Org":"SWS事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1. 新客户开拓（主责）\n自主搭建基于产品线规划产品的国内目标客户地图，完成客户分层、优先级排序与开拓节奏规划。\n通过行业展会、产业链上下游（方案商 / 芯片原厂 / 结构件与组装厂）、渠道商、行业协会等多触点主动获取线索。\n完成从线索 → 有效商机 → 方案推介 → 立项的完整前端推进，并对漏斗各环节的转化负责。\n2. 方案型销售与需求转化\n读懂客户的产品定义诉求，将模糊需求翻译为可报价的方案组合。\n与产品、研发团队协同输出方案建议书与报价，对方案的技术可行性边界具备基本判断力。\n主导商务谈判，覆盖价格、账期、供货与知识产权条款。\n3. 客户关系与生态建设\n建立并维护客户侧产品、研发、采购三层决策链的关系，识别真实决策人。\n维护方案商、代理商、渠道商等中介生态，形成持续线索供给。\n4. 市场情报与竞品跟踪\n持续收集竞品信息、报价策略与客户动态，输出结构化对比。\n将客户需求趋势及时反馈至产品线，驱动产品定义与方案迭代。","Require":"必备条件\n1. 大专及以上学历，电子、通信、自动化、市场营销或相关专业。\n2. 5 年以上 To B 硬件销售经验，其中 2 年以上 PCBA 方案或整机方案销售经验。\n3. 具备独立开拓新客户的完整实战案例（≥2 个）。\n4. 熟悉硬件方案销售流程：需求澄清 → 方案选型 → 报价 → 立项 → design-in 跟进。对国内一、二线品牌、渠道自有品牌、电商品牌的产品与采购决策链有实际认知。\n5. 具备基础技术理解力，能读懂客户规格需求并与研发有效对话。\n6. 优秀的商务谈判与跨部门协同能力。\n7. 能适应不定期出差。\n加分项\n具备穿戴或 IoT 品类（智能手表、儿童手表、老人手表等其他穿戴）的 PCBA 方案或整机方案客户资源。\n熟悉 RedCap / LTE Cat1 / LTE Cat4 等通信制式差异及对应的产品定位；\n有从头部 ODM 向 PCBA 方案商或整机方案商转型的经验。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-13T17:23:59","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"ef5dfc8a-ffb6-4126-8745-56d56e2bf085","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561313758,"PostDateInt":1791860627000,"PostDate":"2026-10-13T11:03:47","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"包装工程师(J14320)","OrgId":1774591,"Org":"包装与夹具开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"10K-15K 元/月","Duty":"1、承接项目包装相关工作，按计划完成包装设计开发交付工作。\n2、根据产品需求，完成包装需求评估，拉通产品经理、项目经理、产品SE、认证代表、制造、质量等完成包装方案设计，输出包装工程图纸和包装明细，制作包装说明文档，完成包装BOM发布。\n3、对接包装供应商，沟通打样需求，跟进包材打样，确保包装按计划完成交付。\n4、跟踪包装可靠性测试验收情况，解决包装问题，确保满足可靠性要求。\n5、支撑采购完成包装供应商审核导入工作。\n6、负责新包装设计方案导入，方案优化等工作。","Require":"1、熟悉各包装材料特性、设计基本要求、可靠性测试要求。\n2、熟练掌握PROE、AutoCAD、AI等设计工具","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-13T11:03:47","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f61bf22f-6a50-4266-a46c-8857a85ebb44","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561313658,"PostDateInt":1791855420000,"PostDate":"2026-10-13T09:37:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"软件项目经理(SPM)(J14318)","OrgId":700541121,"Org":"SWS软件开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1.负责智能穿戴产品（手表/手环）软件项目的全流程管理，作为软件交付的第一责任人，对项目进度、质量与交付结果负责，确保项目按时高质量交付\n2.负责产品项目软件接口对接，与硬件团队、算法团队、云端/App 团队、UI/UX 团队等协作方进行接口定义与对齐，明确各模块交付边界与联调依赖关系\n3.制定项目软件计划及软件 SPEC，拆解里程碑节点，定义各阶段的交付物、验收标准与责任人，建立清晰的项目基线\n4.统筹版本发布管理，制定版本发布节奏（日构建/周版本/里程碑版本/量产版本），把控版本准入准出标准，确保交付节奏与质量可控\n5.负责需求分析管理，组织需求评审（PRD 评审/技术方案评审），进行需求拆解与任务分配，跟踪需求变更影响范围，确保需求闭环\n6.负责 BUG 全生命周期管理，组织 BUG 分配、优先级评定与修复跟踪，推动疑难 BUG 的根因分析与闭环，定期输出质量度量报告\n7.协调项目交叉工作，识别跨团队协作中的依赖与阻塞点，推动系统/驱动/应用/通信/算法等团队高效协作，保障关键路径上的任务按时推进\n8.识别项目风险（进度风险/技术风险/资源风险/依赖风险），制定应对策略并推动问题解决，定期组织风险评审与项目站会\n9.组织项目复盘，总结经验教训，推动流程优化与团队效能提升，沉淀项目管理规范与最佳实践","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，计算机、电子、通信、自动化等相关专业。\n2.具备 2 年以上手机、手表等智能穿戴设备的软件研发经验，熟悉智能穿戴产品的软件架构与技术栈（BES 平台 + Vela NuttX OS 优先）\n3.具备 2 年及以上 SPM（软件项目经理）相关工作经验，有完整的智能穿戴产品从立项到量产的软件项目管理经验\n4.熟悉软件项目全流程管理，具备需求分析、计划制定、进度跟踪、风险管理、版本发布管理的实操经验，熟练使用项目管理工具（Jira）\n5.熟悉嵌入式软件开发生命周期，理解 Boot/驱动/应用/通信等各模块的开发节奏与联调依赖关系，能与研发团队进行有效技术沟通\n6.具备需求评审与 BUG 管理能力，能组织技术评审、判断需求合理性、评估工作量与风险，推动 BUG 闭环与质量度量\n7.责任心强，工作细心，有耐心，具备优秀的组织协调能力与跨团队推动能力，逻辑思维能力清晰，沟通表达能力强，能承受多项目并行的压力\n8.沟通能力和表达能力强\n9.有一线品牌的ODM软件项目管理经验者优先\n10.英语口语优秀者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-13T09:37:00","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"Hid